    "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 2121 experienced an overall gross strengthening of GBP 3.7 million in its prior year reserves for 2019. This deterioration was primarily driven by adverse development in Casualty (third party liability), Energy, and Professional Lines (pecuniary loss) accounts, partially offset by favorable development in Treaty reinsurance acceptances. Specific prior year events contributing to reserve movements included a strengthening in casualty reserves for the 2017 year of account due to California wildfires and the MGM shooting, and gross strengthening but net improvement related to Typhoon Jebi from 2018.",
    "raw_causal_phrases": [
      "An overall deterioration of GBP 3.7 million on prior years' provisions was experienced during the year.",
      "Deteriorations of GBP 11.5 million on third party liability, GBP 4.3 million on energy and GBP 3.4 million on pecuniary loss were largely offset by an improvement of GBP 17.5 million on reinsurance acceptances.",
      "The 2017 year also required a strengthening of the reserves within the casualty account, in line with the market, following increased medium sized losses from the California wildfires and the MGM shooting in the US.",
      "significant creep within the market in the size of the Typhoon Jebi loss that occurred in 2018, which also impacted Syndicate 2121 on a gross basis. This loss was recoverable under the reinsurance programme at year end 2018 and the net position has improved due to the structure of the reinsurance protections purchased."
